\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">4. 關於鑽石、石墨及固態 CO₂，下列哪些敘述正確？（多選）</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g4_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g4_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 鑽石與石墨具有不同的碳原子排列方式</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g5_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g5_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 固態 CO₂ 是共價網狀固體</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g6_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g6_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 石墨的導電性與離域電子有關</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_g7_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\"></button><label for=\"_r_g7_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 鑽石硬度高與三維共價鍵網路有關</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"md\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案</span></button></div></div></div>\n<h3 class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"title\" data-d-size=\"md\" data-d-weight=\"semibold\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">課綱核對補充</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">查核教育部 108 課綱及國家教育研究院課程手冊後，可以確認本章的價鍵理論、混成軌域與分子形狀屬於高中加深加廣選修化學範圍，並非全部都是高中必修內容。<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-inline=\"\"><span class=\"Trigger-y4ejT1\" data-d-component=\"popover-trigger\" data-d-inline=\"\" data-d-inline-text=\"\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-inline=\"\"><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Pill-vMH1qo\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-hoverable=\"\" style=\"background: var(--gray-400);\"><span class=\"Favicon-gpdrW0\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4 FaviconBox-doeXm2\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"favicon\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-width=\"\" data-d-has-height=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0; height: 12px; width: 12px;\"><img class=\"Image-LDLXtM Image-S6ohsd\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://www.dwm.kh.edu.tw&amp;sz=32\"></div></span><span class=\"Label-f1ZlTd\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"3xs\" data-d-inline=\"\" data-d-truncate=\"true\" data-d-clamp-lines=\"true\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary); -webkit-line-clamp: 1;\">高雄市立大灣國民中學</span></span><span class=\"Count-sWqf87\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"3xs\" data-d-inline=\"\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-tertiary);\">+1</span></span></div></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">此外，正式課綱還包含分子極性與分子間作用力，這兩項與本章的結構和物質性質密切相關。由於你原先的清單沒有將它們列為獨立主題，本講義只簡要提及，未展開完整教學；若後續沒有專門章節，建議補入。<span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-inline=\"\"><span class=\"Trigger-y4ejT1\" data-d-component=\"popover-trigger\" data-d-inline=\"\" data-d-inline-text=\"\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-inline=\"\"><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Pill-vMH1qo\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-hoverable=\"\" style=\"background: var(--gray-400);\"><span class=\"Favicon-gpdrW0\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4 FaviconBox-doeXm2\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"favicon\" data-d-directi